{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The cache-oriented 3D launch regressed most cases, so I’m retaining the original linear row order. I’m now testing a more targeted idea for short sequences: compute several heads for one mask row in the same program, which shares the mask load and reduces scheduling overhead without changing the math."}}
